A minimum 3 years of experience (mandatory) in either Account Management, Sales, Underwriting, or related roles in an insurance brokerage or insurance company. Exposure to Underwriting, Commercial Insurance (Commercial Enterprise as well as Commercial General Liability Insurance), or Group Insurance is preferred;
